{"version":1,"content":"<p>咖啡巨頭星巴克（Starbucks）進駐內地逾二十年，今日（22日）起全線8000間門店首次實施「消費入座」。</p><p>南京及北京多家門店已擺放提示牌，但據報執行以友善提醒為主。</p><p>有南京店員表示，空位充足時不會勸離未消費的人。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:41:23.748217+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633164+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:37:43.698499+00:00","content_hash":"d379b77cbde3d31146ad4b3c0d04c8317fe24b76d07d5671fcf71824ae6310e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}